1. f_candleTrack(bool isNew) after f_rangeTrack (833). var state h0, l0, h1, l1, c1 (= close[1] at the change), h2, l2, n0, n1. Returns [h1, l1, c1, h0, l0, n0, n1, cls] with cls: 1 close-through up, 2 bear CRT, −1 close-through down, −2 bull CRT, 0 inside, ±3 outside closing beyond, 4 outside closing inside.

