proposals.rationale:
The engine reads no market metadata, which causes visible mislabels:
- 'LDN H/L' on stock pre-market (04:00-05:00);
- Asia/London/NY pools and killzones on crypto weekends;
- a silently missing midnight open on stocks;
- partial windows pushed as full session pools.

Every other asset proposal reads the profile. This is correctness and UX; no forecasting claim.

proposals.spec:
Inputs (G_CONF, display.none):
