- futures/FX: as today.
Avoid session day digits (overnight-string day = end day per concepts/sessions.md); gate with dayofweek instead.

Coverage guard: f_sessTrack (836-866) gets var int nIn (reset at session start, +1 while inS) returned as a 6th element. At the pushes (1800-1809) require nIn x chartS / 60 >= covMin x winMin, with winMin from TIME-1(a)'s parsed minutes (wrap handling).

Display: Terminal line 'MKT IDX FUT · DAY 18:00 ET · RTH 09:30-16:15'; Clean style gets a tooltip line only.

Where: inputs after 226; detection before 945; gating at 947-950, 964-966, 971-976.

Keep request contexts keyed on the simple mktS.

proposals.rationale:
Three defects share one root:
- wall-clock bars/day makes PD/PW/HTF freshness 1.9-2.3x too slow on stocks;
- stub days (CME outage 4-bar day, FX Sunday candles on 00:00-UTC feeds) are pushed as full tier-0.80 PDH/PDL;
