proposals.spec:
Input gapATR = Auto | On | Off; Auto = on when mkt is 4 or 5.

Compute every ta.* call at global scope, every bar:
- trX = gapBar ? high - low : ta.tr(true);
- atrG = ta.rma(trX, atrLen); atrS = ta.atr(atrLen); atr = useGapATR ? atrG : atrS (replaces 874);
