Condition: mkt == 2, chartS <= 900, and the bar overlaps 16:55-17:15 NY (metals also 18:00-18:10) by the TIME-1(a) overlap test.

In that window:
- a liquidity level needs close beyond lv.nearEdge() to be swept;
- a wick-only touch increments lv.tests and the level stays;
- in f_step, liquidity hits on those bars need a close too.

